  "title": "Vermicelli Salad",
  "description": "This salad couldn &#39;t be easier to fix. The dressing is bottled but zipped up with a bit of salad seasoning mix. The pasta only takes moments to cook and while it &#39;s doing that you can combine the chopped tomato, bell pepper, red onion, and black olives. Refrigerate overnight to mingle all the nice flavors. Serves six.",
